{
  "answer": "**答案：分贝（dB）。**\n\nSQNR 是信号功率与量化噪声功率之比取对数，所以用 dB 表示。按功率比算是 10·log10(信号功率/噪声功率)。按电压比算则用 20·log10。\n\n在 A/D 转换里，经验值是每增加 1 个量化位，SQNR 约增加 6 dB。例如 16 位约为 96 dB。\n\n我只搜了 1 次。上面的公式和经验值来自搜索结果的摘要，我没有打开原页面核对。\n\nSources:\n- [A Quantization-Friendly Separable Convolution for MobileNets](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.08607)\n- [Because the ADC outputs only levels there is inherently noise in the quantized (CCRMA, Stanford)](https://ccrma.stanford.edu/CCRMA/Courses/252/sensors/node41.html)\n- [signal to quantization noise ratio (SQNR) – itwissen.info](https://itwissen.info/en/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-SQNR.html)\n- [Signal-to-Quantization Noise Ratio (SQNR) – Vibration Research](https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/lesson/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr/)",
